{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q3707875","formula":"C₆H₆N₄O₈","hill":"C6H6N4O8","elements":["H","C","N","O"],"composition":{"C":6.0,"H":6.0,"N":4.0,"O":8.0},"names":{"en":"TEX"},"descriptions":{"en":"TEX (chemical name 4,10-dinitro-2,6,8,12-tetraoxa-4,10-diazatetracyclo[5.5.0.05,9.03,11]-dodecane) is a dense (ρ = 1.985 g cm−3) nitramine high explosive, that derives from the very powerful and sensitive high explosive CL-20. Though related to CL-20 in that is shares the same cage structure, TEX is more easily synthesized in good yield from inexpensive starting materials. Unlike CL-20, TEX is friction insensitive, bears a low impact sensitivity, and possesses a very low shock sensitivity and large critical diameter, making it an interesting explosive filler for insensitive munitions."},"fame":6,"pubchemCid":370572,"mass":262.13,"charge":0,"smiles":"C12C3N(C4C(N1[N+](=O)[O-])OC(O4)C(O2)O3)[N+](=O)[O-]","inchikey":"XXEQEMFCUFXLME-UHFFFAOYSA-N","iupac":"4,10-dinitro-2,6,8,12-tetraoxa-4,10-diazatetracyclo[5.5.0.03,11.05,9]dodecane","classes":[{"qid":"Q113145171","names":{"en":"type of chemical entity","ru":"тип химического объекта","uk":"тип хімічної сутності"}}],"structureInfo":{"kind":"molecule","source":"pubchem","ref":"370572","atoms":24,"license":"PubChem (NIH), public data"},"structure":{"kind":"molecule","atoms":[{"x":-1.139,"y":0.892,"z":1.514,"el":"O"},{"x":1.138,"y":0.892,"z":1.514,"el":"O"},{"x":-1.139,"y":1.431,"z":-1.02,"el":"O"},{"x":1.139,"y":1.431,"z":-1.02,"el":"O"},{"x":-3.196,"y":-1.306,"z":0.853,"el":"O"},{"x":3.197,"y":-1.306,"z":0.853,"el":"O"},{"x":-3.212,"y":-0.683,"z":-1.276,"el":"O"},{"x":3.212,"y":-0.683,"z":-1.276,"el":"O"},{"x":-1.32,"y":-0.823,"z":-0.175,"el":"N"},{"x":1.321,"y":-0.823,"z":-0.175,"el":"N"},{"x":-2.675,"y":-0.946,"z":-0.201,"el":"N"},{"x":2.675,"y":-0.946,"z":-0.201,"el":"N"},{"x":0.774,"y":-0.453,"z":1.14,"el":"C"},{"x":0.774,"y":0.05,"z":-1.226,"el":"C"},{"x":-0.774,"y":0.049,"z":-1.226,"el":"C"},{"x":-0.774,"y":-0.454,"z"